+**The data:** `public/framework/ai/whisper/bucket.jsonl`, one temporary, git-ignored bucket. Writer: `Dictate.log_whisper()` → `WhisperLog.record()` (every surface: chat composer, voice strip, widget, Refine). Readers: `WhisperDemo` via `JSONL.live()`. New session appends a marker line; nothing is deleted. A browser driven by a script (`navigator.webdriver`: smoke, tests) never writes it, so demo runs stay out; a test of the log itself sets `window.$WHISPER_LOG_FORCE = true` first (`WhisperLog.automated()`).
 
 - `Whisper.js`: `class Whisper` (url, status up/down, ping, restarts seen, its sessions) and `Whisper.View`. `Whisper.shared` is one per page.
 - `WhisperSession.js`: `class WhisperSession`, one per dictation surface. `record(line)` logs each request (audio size, seconds, reply, latency) and notes revisions where an earlier word changed. Lines are appended to a per-day log under `ai/whisper/`. Has `WhisperSession.View`.
